---
layout: base.njk
description: "Marzooq Subhani: Mathematics and Philosophy student at the University of Bristol, writer of the Substack Grounded, and photographer from Cardiff."
---
{%- macro tip(word, note) -%}
<button type="button" class="tip">{{ word | safe }}<span class="pop" role="tooltip">{{ note }}</span></button>
{%- endmacro -%}

<section class="hero">
  <figure class="portrait">
    <img src="/images/portrait-brandon-hill.jpg" alt="Portrait of Marzooq Subhani at Brandon Hill, Bristol" width="1200" height="1800">
    <figcaption class="label">{% t "Brandon Hill, Bristol", "Brandon Hill, Bryste" %}</figcaption>
  </figure>
  <div class="hero-text">
    <span class="label amber">{% t "Cardiff · Bristol", "Caerdydd · Bryste" %}</span>
    <h1>{% t "Philosophy, writing and photographs.", "Athroniaeth, ysgrifennu a ffotograffau." %}</h1>
    <div class="bio">
      <div class="l-en" lang="en">
        <p>I'm Marzooq Subhani, a final-year Mathematics and Philosophy student at the University of Bristol, from Cardiff.</p>
        <p>I'm interested in how people live together and what they owe each other: social and political philosophy, ethics, philosophy of religion, and {{ tip("philosophy beyond the Western canon", "Mostly Islamic philosophy and South Asian thought, with the odd detour into Chinese philosophy.") }}. I write about ethics, faith and society on my Substack, {{ tip("<em>Grounded</em>", "Long-form essays on ethics, faith and society, from the case for Muslim humanities to the ethics of civil violence.") }}, and I'm president of the University's {{ tip("Academic Research Society", "ResSoc: a student society that helps undergraduates get into research and get it published.") }}.</p>
        <p>When I'm not reading, I'm usually behind a camera, shooting landscapes and travel (mostly around Wales) and taking on portrait, graduation and event work in Bristol.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="l-cy" lang="cy">
        <p>Marzooq Subhani ydw i, myfyriwr Mathemateg ac Athroniaeth yn fy mlwyddyn olaf ym Mhrifysgol Bryste, o Gaerdydd.</p>
        <p>Mae gen i ddiddordeb yn y ffordd mae pobl yn byw gyda'i gilydd a'r hyn sy'n ddyledus ganddyn nhw i'w gilydd: athroniaeth gymdeithasol a gwleidyddol, moeseg, athroniaeth crefydd, ac {{ tip("athroniaeth y tu hwnt i'r canon Gorllewinol", "Athroniaeth Islamaidd a meddwl De Asia yn bennaf, gydag ambell daith i athroniaeth Tsieineaidd.") }}. Dw i'n ysgrifennu am foeseg, ffydd a chymdeithas ar fy Substack, {{ tip("<em>Grounded</em>", "Ysgrifau hir am foeseg, ffydd a chymdeithas, o'r achos dros ddyniaethau Mwslimaidd i foeseg trais sifil.") }}, a fi yw llywydd {{ tip("Cymdeithas Ymchwil Academaidd", "ResSoc: cymdeithas myfyrwyr sy'n helpu israddedigion i ddechrau ymchwilio a chyhoeddi eu gwaith.") }} y Brifysgol.</p>
        <p>Pan nad ydw i'n darllen, dw i fel arfer y tu ôl i gamera, yn tynnu lluniau tirluniau a theithio (o gwmpas Cymru gan amlaf) ac yn gwneud gwaith portreadau, graddio a digwyddiadau ym Mryste.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="band photos-strip">
  <div class="section-head">
    <h2>{% t "Photographs", "Ffotograffau" %}</h2>
    <a href="/photography/">{% t "See the portfolio", "Gweld y portffolio" %}</a>
  </div>
  <div class="strip">
    {%- for p in photos.personal | selectattr("featured") %}{% if loop.index <= 3 %}
    <figure>
      <img src="{{ p.image }}" alt="{{ p.caption or 'Photograph by Marzooq Subhani' }}" loading="lazy">
      {% if p.caption %}<figcaption class="label">{{ p.caption }}</figcaption>{% endif %}
    </figure>
    {% endif %}{%- endfor %}
  </div>
</section>

<section class="split">
  <div id="now" class="now">
    <h2>{% t "Now", "Nawr" %}</h2>
    <span class="label amber">{% t "Updated", "Diweddarwyd" %} {{ now.updated }}</span>
    <ul>
      {%- for item in now.items %}<li>{{ item }}</li>{% endfor %}
    </ul>
  </div>
  <div id="writing" class="writing">
    <div class="section-head">
      <h2>{% t "Writing", "Ysgrifennu" %}</h2>
      <a href="https://groundedbymarzooq.substack.com">{% t "All essays on Grounded", "Pob ysgrif ar Grounded" %}</a>
    </div>
    <div class="posts">
      {%- for post in writing | featuredPosts(substack) %}
      <a class="post" href="{{ post.url }}">
        {% if post.cover %}<img src="{{ post.cover }}" alt="" loading="lazy">{% else %}<span class="cover-blank" aria-hidden="true"></span>{% endif %}
        <span class="post-text">
          <span class="post-title">{{ post.title }}</span>
          <span class="post-sub">{{ post.subtitle }}</span>
        </span>
        <span class="read">{% t "Read →", "Darllen →" %}</span>
      </a>
      {%- endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
